 "remarks": "FOR SALE: TURN-KEY RESTAURANT IN NORWALK, CT - \"EL RANCHO\" Discover an incredible opportunity to own El Rancho, a well-established restaurant in the heart of Norwalk! This fully operational business is ready for its next owner - whether you're an experienced restaurateur or an ambitious investor looking to step into a profitable venture. Property Highlights: * Prime location with high visibility and steady foot traffic * Fully equipped kitchen with professional appliances included * Beautiful dining area with authentic charm and flexible seating * Strong reputation and loyal customer base * Turn-key operation - start earning on day one * Ideal for a variety of concepts: Latin cuisine, fusion, bar & grill, or cafe This is your chance to take over a respected establishment in one of Fairfield County's most active markets. With Norwalk's continued growth and diverse dining scene, the potential to expand, rebrand, or simply continue the success of El Rancho is truly unmatched. Don't miss out - opportunities like this rarely come up in such a desirable location!",
